Word list (src/wordlist.js)
---------------------------
The 2048 words are the Spanish word list of BIP-39 ("Mnemonic code for
generating deterministic keys"), by Marek Palatinus, Pavol Rusnak, Aaron
Voisine and Sean Bowe.

Source:   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bitcoin/bips/master/bip-0039/spanish.txt
Document: https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0039.mediawiki
License:  MIT. The BIP-39 document states "License: MIT" in its header and,
          under "Copyright", "This BIP falls under the MIT License."

Modification: each word was normalized to lowercase ASCII (Unicode NFD
decomposition, combining marks removed, e.g. "n" with tilde becomes "n"). The
order and the set of words are otherwise unchanged. After normalization the
list still has 2048 unique entries.
